// Title: Local System Accounts Discovery Attempt - Linux
// Author: Alejandro Ortuno, oscd.community, CheraghiMilad
// Date: 2020-10-08
// Level: low
// Description: Detects attempts to enumerate local user accounts via common Linux utilities and sensitive file access.
// Adversaries may read files such as /etc/passwd, /etc/shadow, and /etc/sudoers, or use tools like getent,
// id, who, and finger to identify accounts and privilege levels on a compromised system.
// MITRE Tactic: Discovery
// Tags: attack.discovery, attack.t1087.001
// Reference: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/linux/process_creation/proc_creation_lnx_local_account.yml
// False Positives:
//   - Legitimate administration activities

DeviceProcessEvents
| where (((ProcessCommandLine contains " passwd" or ProcessCommandLine contains " shadow") and FolderPath endswith "/getent") or FolderPath endswith "/id" or (FolderPath endswith "/lastlog" or FolderPath endswith "/last" or FolderPath endswith "/lastb") or (ProcessCommandLine contains "-u" and FolderPath endswith "/lsof") or ((ProcessCommandLine contains "/etc/passwd" or ProcessCommandLine contains "/etc/shadow" or ProcessCommandLine contains "/etc/sudoers" or ProcessCommandLine contains "master.passwd" or ProcessCommandLine contains "pwd.db") and (FolderPath endswith "/cat" or FolderPath endswith "/ed" or FolderPath endswith "/emacs" or FolderPath endswith "/head" or FolderPath endswith "/less" or FolderPath endswith "/makemap" or FolderPath endswith "/more" or FolderPath endswith "/nano" or FolderPath endswith "/sqlite3" or FolderPath endswith "/tail" or FolderPath endswith "/vi" or FolderPath endswith "/vim")) or ProcessCommandLine contains "x:0:" or (FolderPath endswith "/finger" or FolderPath endswith "/users" or FolderPath endswith "/w" or FolderPath endswith "/who") or (ProcessCommandLine contains "passwd" and FolderPath endswith "/ypcat")) and (not((FolderPath endswith "/who" and InitiatingProcessCommandLine contains "/usr/bin/landscape-sysinfo")))